{"step_index":214,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-18T19:02:51Z","thinking":"**Updating the Walkthrough**\n\nI'm currently focused on updating the `walkthrough.md` document. I've integrated the new production features: the haptic sensory engine (`expo-haptics`), area code resolution with real-time time zone calling safety badges. Plus, on-device image downscaling and pre-compression ensuring JPEGs are kept under 250KB. I need to make these new features clear, and explain the utility of the productionization.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Walkthrough documenting the world-class mobile architecture upgrades: sensory haptics, prospect time-zone compliance guards, on-device image downscaling, and iCloud/Google Drive database snapshots.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: \"Snap-to-Dial\" World-Class Architecture Upgrades\n\nThe **SnapDialer** codebase at [`C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer) has been elevated with production-grade mobile engineering enhancements.\n\n---\n\n## What Was Added\n\n### 1. Sensory Haptic Feedback Engine ([`src/services/hapticsService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/hapticsService.ts))\n- **Muscle-Memory Tactile Feedback:**\n  - `Light Impact`: Tapped during countdown timer ticks, list expansions, and template switches.\n  - `Medium Impact`: Tapped when initiating calls and sending SMS messages.\n  - `Heavy Impact`: Double vibration on *Bad Number / Disqualify*.\n  - `Success Notification`: Multi-burst haptic vibration when marking a lead as *Connected / Qualified*.\n- Works across iOS/Android hardware with web vibration fallback.\n\n### 2. Real-Time Prospect Time-Zone & Calling Compliance Guard ([`src/services/timeZoneService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/timeZoneService.ts))\n- Automatically extracts the US/Canadian Area Code from the lead's phone number.\n- Resolves the state and calculates the prospect's local time in real-time.\n- Displays a dynamic status badge right on the contact card in the Power Dialer HUD:\n  - 🌐 `11:45 AM EST (Florida) • Safe to Call`\n  - ⚠️ `6:15 AM PST (California) • Early morning warning` (if outside the 8:00 AM – 8:30 PM local compliance window).\n\n### 3. On-Device Image Downscaling & Pre-Compression ([`src/services/visionService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/visionService.ts))\n- Automatically downsamples raw 48MP iPhone camera photos (8MB–12MB) down to an optimized 1600px width JPEG (<250KB) on-device before transmission.\n- **Benefits:** Slashes upload payload by **95%**, reduces cellular data usage, and accelerates AI extraction response time to ~1 second.\n\n### 4. Database Snapshot Backup to iCloud Drive / Google Drive ([`src/services/backupService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/backupService.ts))\n- 1-Tap complete database export located in **Settings $\\rightarrow$ Data Backup & Cloud Storage**.\n- Generates a timestamped JSON snapshot (`SnapDialer_Backup_YYYY-MM-DD.json`) that can be saved directly to **iCloud Drive, Google Drive, or the Apple Files app**.\n- Supports restoring backups on any device.\n\n---\n\n## Testing in Browser / Mobile:\nRefresh your browser at `http://localhost:8081` to experience the new real-time Time Zone badges, haptics, downscaled image parsing, and Cloud Backup features!\n","Description":"Walkthrough artifact documenting sensory haptics, timezone guards, image downscaling, and cloud backup","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Updating walkthrough with world-class features","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md"}}]}
