{"step_index":220,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T15:22:42Z","thinking":"**Reviewing Immediate Steps**\n\nI'm currently focused on the three immediate next steps. First, I'm examining implementing swipe gesture controls for contact cards. I am evaluating the right swipe gesture for dialing or calling a contact. The micro-interactions will need to be fluid.\n\n\n**Implementing Next Steps**\n\nI've got three crucial elements to address next. First, a left swipe on a lead card will advance to the next, with smooth, animated transitions. Then, a fallback offline OCR parser with regex and pattern matching is next on my list to parse text or scanned documents without relying on external APIs. Lastly, I'm integrating smart follow-up scheduling using SQLite with local notifications.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer\\src\\screens\\DialerHudScreen.tsx","EndLine":100,"StartLine":1,"toolAction":"Viewing DialerHudScreen.tsx","toolSummary":"View DialerHudScreen imports and state"}}]}
